        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "91179c56-4208-5815-9806-155be480966e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Battle of Okinawa, Operation Nordwind\n- Places: Okinawa, Alsace, Lorraine, northeastern France, Western Front\n- Topics: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Operation Nordwind was the last major German offensive of World War II on the Western Front.\n- Operation Nordwind began on 31 December 1944 in Alsace and Lorraine in northeastern France.\n- The Battle of Okinawa lasted 82 days from 1 April 1945 until 22 June 1945.\n- Operation Nordwind ended on 25 January 1945.",
